## Application shell

- `src/app/layout.tsx` is the root layout. It loads PT Sans, global CSS, and
  `src/components/providers.tsx`.
- `src/components/providers.tsx` is the client provider boundary for theme,
  TanStack Query, toast notifications, and Google Analytics.
- `src/components/custom-ui/tanstack-providers.tsx` creates the QueryClient.
  Browser renders reuse a singleton; server renders create a fresh instance.
- `src/app/(client)/layout.tsx` wraps public pages with the shared header,
  main content area, and footer.
- `src/app/global-error.tsx`, `src/app/(client)/not-found.tsx`, and
  `src/app/(client)/loading.tsx` provide global error, not-found, and loading
  states.

